{"unit_id":"xgone__dsh-redis#card-zh","repo":"xgone/dsh-redis","commit":"311fee7f684f079682dd8858933c99f2cc86bfd9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-redis 是一个 DSH Redis 插件，为 Agent 提供连接检查、数据读取和数据管理工具。它将 14 个 Redis 工具注册到 DSH，包括连接健康检查、按 key 读取 string/hash/list/set/zset、条件写入和过期设置、删除 key、维护集合与列表，以及按模式扫描 key。读取结果包含类型与 TTL，扫描和集合读取受数量限制；默认对写入和删除操作逐次请求用户确认。适合需要让 DSH Agent 查询或维护 Redis 数据的开发与运维场景。需配置可访问的 Redis 连接；可选设置远程连接地址和密码环境变量。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:95-110","tools.js:175-239","tools.js:254-334","tools.js:583-655","cordis.patch.example.yml:6-19"]}
{"unit_id":"xgone__dsh-redis#card-en","repo":"xgone/dsh-redis","commit":"311fee7f684f079682dd8858933c99f2cc86bfd9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-redis gives DSH agents 14 tools to check connections, read Redis values, update or delete data, and scan keys. Reads return type and TTL with configured limits. Writes and deletes ask for approval by default. Configure a reachable Redis service and optional remote URL and password.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:95-110","tools.js:175-239","tools.js:254-334","tools.js:583-655","cordis.patch.example.yml:6-19"]}
