{"unit_id":"xgone__dsh-redis#feature-1","repo":"xgone/dsh-redis","commit":"311fee7f684f079682dd8858933c99f2cc86bfd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-redis 的功能「检查连接」：Agent 调用 redis_health 查看配置的 Redis 连接状态和插件限制；redis_list 可逐一执行 PING 并列出连接信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["tools.js:175-213"]}
{"unit_id":"xgone__dsh-redis#feature-2","repo":"xgone/dsh-redis","commit":"311fee7f684f079682dd8858933c99f2cc86bfd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-redis 的功能「读取键值」：调用 redis_get 并提供 key，可读取多种 Redis 数据类型的值，返回类型和 TTL；string 值还可选择尝试解析 JSON。","source":"generated","evidence":["tools.js:109-159","tools.js:216-239"]}
{"unit_id":"xgone__dsh-redis#feature-3","repo":"xgone/dsh-redis","commit":"311fee7f684f079682dd8858933c99f2cc86bfd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-redis 的功能「扫描键」：调用 redis_scan 设置可选的匹配模式和数量上限，分页查找 key；还可选择读取 string 类型的值。","source":"generated","evidence":["tools.js:583-634"]}
{"unit_id":"xgone__dsh-redis#feature-4","repo":"xgone/dsh-redis","commit":"311fee7f684f079682dd8858933c99f2cc86bfd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-redis 的功能「写入保护」：默认配置下，写入或删除工具执行前会显示目标并请求用户确认；用户可允许单次操作或当前会话，拒绝时操作不会获准。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:7-19","index.js:60-105"]}
{"unit_id":"xgone__dsh-redis#caveat-1","repo":"xgone/dsh-redis","commit":"311fee7f684f079682dd8858933c99f2cc86bfd9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-redis 使用配置的 Redis 地址建立 TCP 或 TLS 连接，并通过该服务执行命令；远程连接需提供可访问的 Redis 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["resp.js:76-86","config.js:37-80"]}
